 a collaboration between the Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory (LLNL) and the University of California, San Diego (UCSD) for the application of advanced scientific data management technologies to improve the conduct of a science through the provision of scientific data management technology that enables the organization, manipulation, and analysis of observational and simulation data. (Downloaded on February 12, 2012).\",\"subnote_guid\":\"5bd3196016f5d6fe2eb480f607efe5e9\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ref50\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents note\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(168,1,NULL,302,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"A slide presentation providing an overview of astronomical simulation and its scientific research projects.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"5181b8cd16c16c9f0fc10a873595c5b8\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ref67\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents note\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(169,1,NULL,304,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"\\\"A Renewal of NRAC Proposal MCA098020\\\"\",\"subnote_guid\":\"5708524829e596e8f57f4802771345e3\"}],\"type\":\"odd\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ref54\",\"label\":\"General note\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(170,1,NULL,306,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"A project report for December 2005 and January 2006. The report details objectives of project and barriers encountered.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"345e34f1e8c1aec4a61d5eb1a9f95c6e\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ref66\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents note\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(171,1,NULL,309,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"A web posting describing efforts of scientists and information managers at Livermore and UC San Diego to develop mechanisms for collaborative scientific research involving the massive data sets required for extremely large-scale scientific simulation. The description focuses on two particular projects: Climate simulations and Cosmology Simulations, of which the Santa Fe Light Cone simulation was one. (The description is a sub-section of the \\\"Institute for Scientific Computing Research Annual Report, Fiscal Year 2007.\\\" Consulted and copied from https://iscr.llnl.gov/annual_report/fy2007/luscid.php on 15 February 2012. PDF version of web page generated at same time.)\",\"subnote_guid\":\"1d78e2bf045ff6227c47601375d0727e\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ref47\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents note\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32','2016-08-24 13:29:32',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(172,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_langmaterial\",\"content\":[\"English\"],\"type\":\"langmaterial\",\"persistent_id\":\"f5c97f69f936e3c67e82bd8fec2f9868\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54',NULL,NULL,49,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(173,1,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"Papers include correspondence reflecting Uyemaruko Stump\'s relations with friends, literary colleagues, and government associates; notebooks (1919-1940s) containing drafts of poetry and prose; manuscript drafts of plays; and notes and manuscripts for classroom lectures on modern poetry while attending Carpe Diem University.\"],\"type\":\"abstract\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_de4e03bfadb9fb920cf88614b54f92cf\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(174,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_langmaterial\",\"content\":[\"Languages represented in the collection:English\"],\"type\":\"langmaterial\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_8ac3919e4a1fd89d789073520d8269ba\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54',NULL,NULL,50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(175,1,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Papers include correspondence reflecting Uyemaruko Stump\'s relations with friends, literary colleagues, and government associates; notebooks (1919-1940s) containing drafts of poetry and prose; manuscript drafts of plays; and notes and manuscripts for classroom lectures on modern poetry while attending Carpe Diem University.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"7418d683b62b6ebba132f2eab88592e9\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_3400b706d106d8e7f54f46e53f4842e1\",\"label\":\"Scope and Content of Collection\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(176,1,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Uyemaruko Shokushi was a modernist poet and dramatist, who was active in the New England Poetry Guild during the 1940\'s-1950\'s. She was born in Yokohama, Japan in 1912 and moved to Boston, MA in 1931 as an exchange student at Carpe Diem University, prior to completing her degree in Comparative Literature at Hitotsubashi University. She married Montgomery Stump the following year. Several of their children and grandchildren are also alumni of Carpe Diem University.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"471fff3136a4cbbc27682d17554f7e5e\"}],\"type\":\"bioghist\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_7d74471e9637f68359e41c9413769263\",\"label\":\"Biography\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(177,1,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Donated by Uyemaruko Shokushi, 1995.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"2561435363b45a21cbf502847a2d336f\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_657e8acad7b764f6de2011d92dd5bbe9\",\"label\":\"Acquisition Information\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(178,1,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"No access restrictions. Collection is open to the public.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"9962f0cc443aa6e7165c3b3fa533e4db\"}],\"type\":\"accessrestrict\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_013ea8d7d6d82f2ecaa5455371b1d9c7\",\"label\":\"Access\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54','2016-08-24 13:37:54',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(179,1,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Materials are for use in-library only, non-circulating.\",\"subno