t\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_eba1597822bd977d286e502af5eb3f9a\",\"label\":\"Content\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:44:19','2016-08-24 13:44:19','2016-08-24 13:44:19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(206,1,NULL,327,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Correspondence from and to numerous friends, colleagues, and associates during the years 1952-1992. Correspondents include the French philosopher Michel Foucault, a companon of Congreave\'s on several fly fishing trips to the French Alps; Julia Child, with whom Congreave discussed recipes for serving trout and salmon; and B. F. Skinner, the Harvard behaviorial psychologist, who Congreave met during his final year at Harvard and whith whom Congreave maintained a correspondence, until Skinner\'s death in 1990, about their mutual passion for fly fishing. One letter from 1960 recounts Congreave\'s failed attempt to keep a journal during his fishing trips, which was thwarted when the journal fell into the Housatonic River and washed downstream. At that point Congfreave decided that making copies of his outgoing letters was the best way to document his passion for fly fishing; hence the collection typically includes both incoming and copies of outgoing correspondence.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"85641c29c8474a9fcef4cbc9f1a31c1c\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_9b6c4144d025c5442ebc8d4793d8ed88\",\"label\":\"Content\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:44:20','2016-08-24 13:44:20','2016-08-24 13:44:20',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(207,1,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"subnotes\":[{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"The collection illustrates the history of the Santa Monica Bay Area from 1875 to the present day with historical photographs, postcards and other images including views of the City and its landscape, the Santa Monica Pier, Palisades Park, historic buildings, beaches, Douglas Aircraft and the Southern Pacific Railroad, Venice, Topanga, and Malibu. \",\"publish\":false,\"subnote_guid\":\"d5a1499c9e5d975de845d9655bf1dfcd\"}],\"persistent_id\":\"02c2e02eadf3da2bac15dac09f0cb11f\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:53:56','2016-08-24 13:53:56','2016-08-24 13:53:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(208,1,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"subnotes\":[{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Images were donated to the library from both public and private collections.\",\"publish\":false,\"subnote_guid\":\"591efaf521e68edd07d0dc0608fe3501\"}],\"persistent_id\":\"96c9611ae1ae88b7b8ed6d77fec4ea6b\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:53:56','2016-08-24 13:53:56','2016-08-24 13:53:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(209,1,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"type\":\"accessrestrict\",\"rights_restriction\":{\"local_access_restriction_type\":[]},\"subnotes\":[{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"The Digital Collection is available to all. Original images are in archival storage and have no public access.\",\"publish\":false,\"subnote_guid\":\"6161b5ac277a95b77d33794226ac4198\"}],\"persistent_id\":\"eee873578b58439055ae4f6bcc2da7fc\"}','admin','admin','2016-08-24 13:53:56','2016-08-24 13:53:56','2016-08-24 13:53:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(210,1,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"type\":\"userestrict\",\"rights_restriction\":{\"local_access_restriction_type\":[]},\"subnotes\":[{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"The Library\'s Digital Collections are intended for personal, research, scholarly and educational purposes. Permission to us