t\":\"<emph render=\\\"italic\\\">Sepia postcards depict scenes from Duvall, Wisconsin and unidentified persons. Black-and-white postcards depict Hearst Castle (California), a German train, and Swiss mountain scenes. Some of the postcards are annotated and one is signed \\\"Edith,\\\" but none of them have been addressed or posted.</emph>\",\"subnote_guid\":\"c495318fe6d026fab6a73b94836a2efd\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_35858a126b7b3e845fe4972ffb91b5c4\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','nancye','nancye','2018-11-02 20:57:36','2018-11-02 20:57:36','2018-11-02 20:57:36',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(877,1,NULL,785,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"(7 photographic prints and 1 photographic postcard)\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_54237adf8cb2875eb599b34f4651c463\"}','nancye','nancye','2018-11-02 20:57:36','2018-11-02 20:57:36','2018-11-02 20:57:36',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(878,1,NULL,786,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"(4 photographic prints)\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_6f4ad0017c2b098ef5755a0967b87549\"}','nancye','nancye','2018-11-02 20:57:36','2018-11-02 20:57:36','2018-11-02 20:57:36',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(879,1,NULL,787,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"(5 photographic prints with corresponding negatives)\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_8bed0b14314e36a9928650673c218e35\"}','nancye','nancye','2018-11-02 20:57:36','2018-11-02 20:57:36','2018-11-02 20:57:36',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(881,1,NULL,789,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"(7 photographic prints)\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_1d38940112