o write a review of it.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"2dc404b7f1ed92fd74bd8497dbd4a950\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_4a3c0e001a60a960c2e6162095d91dc5\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1998,1,NULL,1872,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 25 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_d71a2e2913339945004db8e5c4f6d48c\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1999,1,NULL,1872,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"274fb6e776d4c84355a950d46e9e5485\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_2a93ef55440290546b437d52fc8238a5\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2000,1,NULL,1872,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Pascalis writes with citations regarding Rush\'s \\\"Tranquilizer arm-chair\\\" designed for maniacs, as well as details of publishing translations and copyright issues.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"55043b0b20db85d826b8cfe2e59007f5\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_9ab3a55cd222b384fd8a6ad8840b28eb\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2001,1,NULL,1873,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"6 pages; 25 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_9f08a97b70aa5abb9bde47a81a940994\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2002,1,NULL,1873,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"73b1e74d00ee79f78dcee1b7cdfd7281\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_e135a18fe6f78718190c8a0c5ff5fb5a\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2003,1,NULL,1873,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Pickering notes that he sent Yellow Fever medicine developed by Dr. Conrad G. Bölke to the Board of Health, but is only now sending along copies of his letters from Bölke and the United States consul at Hamburg, Joseph Pitcairn, with instructions regarding the medicine\'s use.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"333f1f673b8cb1ee54a11d2ca8dc416f\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_70081808955af3d49b7ff34060c2b448\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2004,1,NULL,1874,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"2 pages; 25 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_42f0e0eeba7138665679df1fd6b11e5c\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2005,1,NULL,1874,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"ecc0c46157654480a5169e1c8712bd90\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_3443519c5cb88500f3bcb0f73ffbcc84\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2006,1,NULL,1874,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Pickering writes regarding his plans for caring for his mentally disturbed son, William, thanking Dr. Rush for his advice. In a postscript, he asks Rush if he should talk to his son about his derangement when he is rational in order to have his cooperation in effecting a cure.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"c675a7afef2c0dbef12e1fcf85fa7193\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_555e687e2721ee896e95575b0da51222\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2007,1,NULL,1875,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"2 pages; 25 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_abc01688a6cd0f308199a7e96d89ee6d\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2008,1,NULL,1875,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"efe82d08781f1a3bcae36f8641d894fd\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_7e6eac590e0903e7612889ea21ad81df\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2009,1,NULL,1875,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Pickering details how the family is no longer able to care for William. He has decided to send William to Rush\'s hospital in Philadelphia, where he will not be able to escape and might recover. He adds that another son, George, is potentially manifesting the same symptoms as William.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"fe78efb92746b85a01f09e126d73c45b\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ce8fee9f228a16832c0d72528fb6a00e\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2010,1,NULL,1876,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"2 pages; 25 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_17d047250db82d938e3c3ddde0305aea\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2011,1,NULL,1876,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"23336234dd1f6e6370ad257271cc7b68\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_0a0f84ded3711702d2cb46950bd251ea\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2012,1,NULL,1876,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Pickering describes symptoms for which he would like Rush\'s treatment advice. Includes Rush\'s own notes regarding two prescriptions he advised.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"7439c06e2491f09e8fca66d232716284\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_23ecf5b7a85e22190a92ce3fc991614a\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2013,1,NULL,1877,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"4 pages; 33 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_b195c2eaf538d66233bfc15f4ba07cec\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2014,1,NULL,1877,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"3c5fc06a2e16dbb484f0db6e785e11ac\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_896043b4d75869e88cf0cab9c462f6ba\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2015,1,NULL,1877,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush congratulates the unnamed recipient on his recent appointment in the army, and makes note of the support of France and Spain in America\'s revolutionary cause, along with other Mediterranean countries. He mentions that the army expects to check any advance of General Howe into Philadelphia, whose appearance would cause a panic. He notes that his opposition to Pennsylvania\'s current government has cost him his seat in Congress, but that he had planned to join the army in any case.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"5d6032c4261c5affb1e84ea790cf55cf\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_a2d7292a2f9132e840a5201bc40270d8\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2016,1,NULL,1878,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 25 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ee0aea0d30ce27c7cacffbb70f6b8036\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45','2019-09-25 01:14:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2017,1,NULL,1878,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"698946345f5d1c6bc1ef5021014ed3bc\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_08492ce08f961b03b2cbd6932fa44cf8\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2018,1,NULL,1878,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush discusses his appointment to the Army, the support of doctors Shippen and Brower for that appointment, his concerns about the medical system and the numbers of deaths the army has experienced, dispatches that have arrived from France, and that John Adams is on his way there.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"909caed0341e39a056715606713ffcf6\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_04b7f5a8afb59f81a26224addb98f605\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2019,1,NULL,1879,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"8 pages; 22 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_8ba22169e85e4b6fe1985e34b5a8fdf3\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2020,1,NULL,1879,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"c25b5568aa3cdc040eaa852c21bbfe6c\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_20401cc5b09acbfa325ffe4d24000ac6\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2021,1,NULL,1879,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush states that he is never indifferent to any thing relating to America, and that the basis for America\'s freedom is broad, but is in danger from a tedious and expensive war, and from \\\"the ignorance, indolence, and avarice of too many of our Whigs.\\\" He follows with questions regarding the country\'s finances, then notes that he has ordered a court-martial of Dr. Shippen, for whom he will serve as prosecutor. A postscript discusses two bills before Congress.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"7e4893fce80f3e724d6220ed2986d32b\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ade0eeb81d628c82afae4af9e36db491\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2022,1,NULL,1880,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 22 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_af8858d3109791ee4a66cd5d18ace7d1\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2023,1,NULL,1880,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"55e914828718c39d668b923c96492bf9\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_393e2b47e62332e9e8226147b8dfb6cc\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2024,1,NULL,1880,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"2-page transcript available\",\"subnote_guid\":\"8012cb7f9b8e3abde9509a2a8863c9ce\"}],\"type\":\"altformavail\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_e2a405c237de40e3d8d0704f639ddc78\",\"label\":\"Existence and Location of Copies\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2025,1,NULL,1880,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush recommends Dr. James Finley to McHenry, and requests that he visit Finley\'s patients with him. He adds that he is forced into a military retirement by Dr. Shippen\'s friends, but takes pleasure in McHenry\'s service. Finally, he comments on the alliance with France.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"2c15bc379f7c42ccfb19f1eb0836dd91\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_6f0cfca6f82fbf3134da9321e3f45fec\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2026,1,NULL,1881,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"2 pages; 21 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_87eb56df0aafb3ccdf79d4e984802f4f\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2027,1,NULL,1881,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"ac06833b822d54400f04e212f6d37cdf\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_13f46eb22a01cf6ba54fd01f2adedbaf\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2028,1,NULL,1881,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush relays his plans to visit Julia. A postscript instructs her how to protect herself and the babies from contracting a fever.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"4a7dd81c3c1f17376e3afff720edccd9\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_0d5987dc7e21250583872f7c48d5d3c8\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2029,1,NULL,1882,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 23 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ede674418ca85eeaa674171e827531dd\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46','2019-09-25 01:14:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2030,1,NULL,1882,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL