ment for the fever. Rush is especially offended because Wistar had originally assented to the efficacy of Rush\'s treatment, then changed his mind.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"f1772b826377d1e318e2f9a553a59324\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_5480d28bd6f02003515e8713fa81f3e1\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2257,1,NULL,1951,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"4 pages; 24 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_9b1d47d3a1f0b778a58614118936499e\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2258,1,NULL,1951,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"5964eb97f393f35e544fb90d82650fdb\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_2a046cfa41a95af7324679470163a9ec\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2259,1,NULL,1951,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"2-page transcript available\",\"subnote_guid\":\"510f38af86d5dc6d9062d0c64008e0bf\"}],\"type\":\"altformavail\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_affcb2e881d9bf815fbf9b76799461ee\",\"label\":\"Existence and Location of Copies\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2260,1,NULL,1951,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"s