her as a \\\"great woman\\\" for never asking him to leave the city during the outbreak.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"f1e096ac60e2d4e3077ae0b67dd05512\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_62e434e644ae8d19d15c707f8465b473\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2272,1,NULL,1955,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 33 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ef09a92d8cf1543d4a6bde01cd03229a\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2273,1,NULL,1955,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"6c6b7088bc3af20c96aed0829a4a1ea3\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_545f02f33cb1bb13792802f2905ffed5\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2274,1,NULL,1955,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush reports having received various letters and items from London, including a medical book. He states that he has had no cases of yellow fever in two days. He uses the rest of the letter to recount fully his second attack of the fever, beginning October 10th. He writes that he expects her return the coming week.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"d89ce69cb3facfca51f528624266f4f0\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_5791033bdfadbf112fd5e046f6b7a849\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2275,1,NULL,1956,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 33 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_aedb812ffefbe4b7902978563efa7b8f\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2276,1,NULL,1956,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"00da39394cd82695a6552b064df74083\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_b8ad9384ab42d14b1c7a5941744cd3ea\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2277,1,NULL,1956,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush outlines the work that will keep him from visiting Julia, after all. He points out that there have been four deaths from fever, so unless there is a frost, she should not return to Philadelphia on the date they agreed upon. He repeats more of the \\\"slander\\\" against him.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"7bca6a6a85aeeae6f06f523a1781a5d5\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_0f560dac2a454c703148ba9bd3b1e392\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2278,1,NULL,1957,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"2 pages; 20 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_b9276e8a3089e69fe0acbd2cb9ba1831\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2279,1,NULL,1957,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"b0e2870f5c977a2ce93ec7aa443dbd43\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_0b6eee699e9524230fc5606a0ffcdcc8\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2280,1,NULL,1957,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"1-page transcript available\",\"subnote_guid\":\"b6d9ca0f4eda3b6cb0bf00744da8fc78\"}],\"type\":\"altformavail\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_e183e746c3643c8af3e3b880d773f783\",\"label\":\"Existence and Location of Copies\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2281,1,NULL,1957,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush points out that he is too weak and busy to ride out to her at Rosehill, but she may come in to town, or he will ride out to spend the next day with her.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"309a422af0dcedf2cb28e38f927411a3\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_8c6ec8193ca8b152f7fd0ec34f57a957\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2282,1,NULL,1958,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 22 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_8cfcda24d262fb897c3dd7c5700e5afb\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2283,1,NULL,1958,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Purchase, 2013\",\"subnote_guid\":\"1ac382f5707a55545a88f7d556303730\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_8e16031de324fd606af77307be35daf1\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2284,1,NULL,1958,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush writes most likely to Dr. Basil G. Middleton, (c. 1740-1818), a former surgeon with Virginia forces in the Revolutionary War, now living in London. Rush discusses personal and medical matters, touching on College of Philadelphia medical school classes and enrollment, and comments on the unconcluded treaty with England and the American political system.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"99eaa248a93006dca8776cd149700fbc\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_3b6498c0d85f45d8c75ac0a475dadd0a\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2285,1,NULL,1959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"1 page; 34 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_089fa321f995adf4bf11ade7b5f64d69\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2286,1,NULL,1959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"0de33227c5df3bcd6b6505bc7747c46a\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ff00d73a33a4bf6e93a7b1cc7313a1bd\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2287,1,NULL,1959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush\'s copy of a letter to a Mr. Harris regarding Rush\'s ability to establish a patent for land in Lewistown.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"ba711ce09d8b3d67b03c5407417af9c7\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_8bdd5dbd8d76ec10bd891591986de9a5\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2288,1,NULL,1960,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 32 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_876f0d51565c737c9bc9fc5d5dfd7fe6\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2289,1,NULL,1960,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"bd16d7382da461f97276ac0abf5fb7a2\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_dc19582afa08f9084ae43a72b6b0b8c1\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2290,1,NULL,1960,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush announces that yellow fever has broken out throughout the city, but there have been no measures yet to exterminate the disease. Their son Richard plans to move a mattress and books to their farm. Rush notes that a Mr. Thomas has left Philadelphia forever as a result of his debts, and has ruined many young men in the meantime. In a postscript, Rush points out that Capt. Mitchell of the American Army has the fever. Rush is considering leaving and is urging his patients to leave. Rush\'s signature has been excised.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"cb52143ce22e6593e888987425beaf5a\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_6cea3d0c38f42a2d7a00d4ef3746187a\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:52','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2291,1,NULL,1961,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 33 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ae1cf49aab12f0115e3f9a82526bea2c\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2292,1,NULL,1961,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"4f34d3f6fbdaa0931c0f3c51e7d9ac1e\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_0e8505aaebf261803423aecf5f52ca62\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2293,1,NULL,1961,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush notes that the fever has increased more in one week than it had in three weeks in 1793 and 1797. He had made plans to leave in 7-10 days when the U. S. Mint was closed, but by the end of the letter announces more immediate plans to remove to Sydenham, which has been prepared for the family and servants. Their son John is arriving via his ship in New Castle. A note was appended to the letter in 1848, saying that the close of the letter was cut out for an autograph seeker.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"2d8248cce54162b218e11f8d3eaffc06\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_4ce583f2bb4d681e6bf963a3c4bc6861\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2294,1,NULL,1962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 32 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_7dec668178efe7201dc952e543aec114\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2295,1,NULL,1962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"5869f6f36e023d5567270521ca64a71a\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_4b98c4d001da71c9021f63bc6dfcadea\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2296,1,NULL,1962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush notes that John arrived, and they are now at Sydenham. He also reports that he has sold the Chapel farm for $2,500. He describes a new remedy he has developed for yellow fever. The signature has been excised from this letter.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"b984d3ec1154a237dbd8bce5472db9de\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_f9b701be248d60b1f2fb5b6862cb36ea\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2297,1,NULL,1963,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 23 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_846ecdd5f7ad2a235b804b0246268309\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2298,1,NULL,1963,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"154eed63f646b3759d8e77eddb427135\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_1244dd1717cf80648b7ad688da1ee93b\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2299,1,NULL,1963,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"2-page transcript available\",\"subnote_guid\":\"9687cd62ec66fe8484a5e2c53223d627\"}],\"type\":\"altformavail\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_cdf978661fe07fc1808eb94bcb0ead4b\",\"label\":\"Existence and Location of Copies\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2300,1,NULL,1963,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush points out that though staying in the country helps him forget all that is going on around him, he cannot forget the poor, sick, and dying in the city. Three more persons were admitted to the hospital this day than were admitted in 1793.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"2774bfc16e4e39264fba3e85945ba3d0\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_8b464ec04157eecca9fd657641046622\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2301,1,NULL,1964,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 23 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_7e07c663ccdab1461ae90b88794cf6c6\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2302,1,NULL,1964,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"c483b69ba3210fa3ecd743aab775aa4f\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_da7b112d5b6337929deda0274d1e8112\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2303,1,NULL,1964,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"2-page transcript available\",\"subnote_guid\":\"fbef7f6179b63336e343fd7a20ec0c18\"}],\"type\":\"altformavail\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_71d972582329f672f6112eb42a0eb3f1\",\"label\":\"Existence and Location of Copies\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2304,1,NULL,1964,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush notes that his pupil is better, and that he is using profuse sweating as part of his treatment for the fever. A later note was appended to the letter stating that Mrs. Rush allowed the signature to be cut away for an autograph.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"b464891af6c7983c8de4f07e8bfee686\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_7466c1e569fe18a1593c531298bdd93d\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2305,1,NULL,1965,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"3 pages; 23 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_48f68db2c5b11403de131ba380437716\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2306,1,NULL,1965,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"cfb03006facfa2f5c5cca21c3cd94023\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_6c12f86241bc51eb58c8dbb0ab8834c9\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2307,1,NULL,1965,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"2-page transcript available\",\"subnote_guid\":\"f3a85e3f4410de5570ad00dad8fb4ca8\"}],\"type\":\"altformavail\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_ac0c380019247330b0a1bf7784a681f1\",\"label\":\"Existence and Location of Copies\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2308,1,NULL,1965,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Rush reports that despite being exposed to the fever daily for two months, he is still healthy. However, he has \\\"felt, mourned, and wept\\\" until he could no longer do so. He reports that poor people chase him down in the street, and that he carries medicine with him in order to do all he can to help them. Free blacks and servants form a large percentage of his patients.\",\"subnote_guid\":\"f780d2441bbbdd1d719f974afb24e6d4\"}],\"type\":\"scopecontent\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_c0e8976f52adbfcd9f3251e48249548e\",\"label\":\"Scope and Contents\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2309,1,NULL,1966,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_singlepart\",\"content\":[\"5 pages; 24 cm\"],\"type\":\"physdesc\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_db62444a41db96282e1987fb6f432f65\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2310,1,NULL,1966,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,_binary '{\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_multipart\",\"subnotes\":[{\"publish\":true,\"jsonmodel_type\":\"note_text\",\"content\":\"Gift of Josiah Charles Trent Collection, 1956\",\"subnote_guid\":\"53da3b1ee52bd030052d727f91a77ae7\"}],\"type\":\"acqinfo\",\"persistent_id\":\"aspace_82d24a4cc680ebcaaa8605b5361e01b8\",\"label\":\"Immediate Source of Acquisition\"}','noahh','noahh','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53','2019-09-25 01:14:53',N